### Datasets (mantener la estructura con .gitkeep, ignorar contenido)

# Streetscapes
**/streetscapes/*
!**/streetscapes/.gitkeep

# VeRi 
**/VeRi/*
!**/VeRi/.gitkeep

# Synthetic dataset
**/synthetic_dataset/*
